  <diagram id="AroqlqViAWTBXR28yrJN" name="第 3 页">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2851" dy="1602" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    START([📥 导入CAD模型]) --&gt; FEATURE[🔍 特征识别模块&lt;br/&gt;FeatureRecognition]\n    \n    FEATURE --&gt; DECOMPOSE{🎯 主控智能体&lt;br/&gt;任务分解}\n    \n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; |并行分支1| VIEW[📐 视图分析&lt;br/&gt;ViewAnalysisAgent]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; |并行分支2| DIM[📏 尺寸分析&lt;br/&gt;DimensionAgent]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; |并行分支3| TOL[⚙️ 公差分析&lt;br/&gt;ToleranceAgent]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; |并行分支4| SURF[🔍 表面分析&lt;br/&gt;SurfaceAgent]\n    \n    VIEW --&gt; VIEW_DETAIL{视图策略}\n    VIEW_DETAIL --&gt; |主视图| MVIEW[主视图生成]\n    VIEW_DETAIL --&gt; |投影| PROJ[投影视图]\n    VIEW_DETAIL --&gt; |剖视| SECT[剖视图]\n    VIEW_DETAIL --&gt; |局部| DETAIL[局部放大]\n    \n    DIM --&gt; DIM_DETAIL{尺寸策略}\n    DIM_DETAIL --&gt; |线性| LINEAR[线性尺寸标注]\n    DIM_DETAIL --&gt; |角度| ANGULAR[角度标注]\n    DIM_DETAIL --&gt; |径向| RADIAL[直径/半径]\n    DIM_DETAIL --&gt; |基准| DATUM[基准要素]\n    \n    TOL --&gt; TOL_DETAIL{公差策略}\n    TOL_DETAIL --&gt; |尺寸公差| SIZETOL[H7/g6匹配]\n    TOL_DETAIL --&gt; |形位公差| GDTOL[GD&amp;T符号]\n    TOL_DETAIL --&gt; |位置公差| POSTOL[位置度]\n    TOL_DETAIL --&gt; |原则| PRINCIPLE[MMC/LMC]\n    \n    SURF --&gt; SURF_DETAIL{表面策略}\n    SURF_DETAIL --&gt; |粗糙度| ROUGH[Ra标注]\n    SURF_DETAIL --&gt; |焊接| WELD[焊缝符号]\n    SURF_DETAIL --&gt; |注释| NOTE[技术要求]\n    \n    MVIEW &amp; PROJ &amp; SECT &amp; DETAIL --&gt; MERGE1[视图集成]\n    LINEAR &amp; ANGULAR &amp; RADIAL &amp; DATUM --&gt; MERGE2[尺寸集成]\n    SIZETOL &amp; GDTOL &amp; POSTOL &amp; PRINCIPLE --&gt; MERGE3[公差集成]\n    ROUGH &amp; WELD &amp; NOTE --&gt; MERGE4[表面集成]\n    \n    MERGE1 &amp; MERGE2 &amp; MERGE3 &amp; MERGE4 --&gt; AGGREGATE[🔄 PMI聚合器&lt;br/&gt;标注整合]\n    \n    AGGREGATE --&gt; VALIDATE{✅ 校验智能体&lt;br/&gt;PMIChecker}\n    \n    VALIDATE --&gt; |规则检查| RULES[📋 标准符合性&lt;br/&gt;ASME Y14.5 / ISO 1101 / GB/T 1182]\n    VALIDATE --&gt; |完整性| COMPLETE[📊 标注完整性&lt;br/&gt;缺失检查]\n    VALIDATE --&gt; |干涉| INTERFERE[⚠️ 干涉检查&lt;br/&gt;标注重叠]\n    \n    RULES &amp; COMPLETE &amp; INTERFERE --&gt; ISSUES{发现问题?}\n    \n    ISSUES --&gt; |有| FIX[🔧 自动修正&lt;br/&gt;+人工审核]\n    ISSUES --&gt; |无| PUBLISH[📤 标注发布]\n    \n    FIX --&gt; VALIDATE\n    \n    PUBLISH --&gt; FORMAT{输出格式}\n    FORMAT --&gt; |STEP AP242| STEP[STEP格式&lt;br/&gt;含PMI信息]\n    FORMAT --&gt; |JT| JT[JT格式&lt;br/&gt;轻量化]\n    FORMAT --&gt; |Native| NATIVE[CAD原生&lt;br/&gt;嵌入模型]\n    FORMAT --&gt; |3D PDF| PDF[3D PDF&lt;br/&gt;审阅]\n    \n    STEP &amp; JT &amp; NATIVE &amp; PDF --&gt; END([📦 发布完成])\n    \n    style DECOMPOSE fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828\n    style VALIDATE fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32\n    style AGGREGATE fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825\n    style PUBLISH fill:#b3e5fc,stroke:#0277bd&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="BTFGSoNFcPAp8HPmbgpN-2">
